An apparatus and a process for the production at high
capacity of high purity powders from a wire using a com
bination of plasma torches and induction heating are dis
closed . The process has good productivity by providing a
preheating system . A mechanism is included in the appara
tus, which allows adjusting the position of the plasma
torches and their angle of attack with respect to the wire,
permitting to control the particle size distribution.


